<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-LIERSE WIN BELGIAN LEAGUE TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIERSE WIN BELGIAN LEAGUE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lierse clinched their first Belgian league title since 1960 with a 3-0 away win against Standard Liege on Sunday.</p>
</text>
